g g6-kenny "A presenter photo of the man in attached image 1, sitting behind a plain white table, leaning slightly forward with both forearms resting on the tabletop, looking at the camera with a calm, curious expression. With his right hand he holds up the light blue phone from attached image 2 toward the camera, showing its back and large triple camera. Keep the face in attached image 1 exactly; do not widen, round, age, average, or blend it. Attached image 2 supplies only the phone's exact design and colour, not a person. He wears a plain black t-shirt. Plain uniform light grey background, even soft lighting, clear margins. Framing: chest up, the phone large in the left third of the frame." --ref $WORKSPACE/src/anchor-1505-face.png --ref $WORKSPACE/src/sourced/iphone-colors.jpg --model gpt-image-flare --quality low --count 2 --size 1536x1024
